  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie av svenskt bidrag till enegisektorn &#xf6;ver 60 &#xe5;r</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study of Swedish contribution to the energy sector over 60 years</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023, Swedish development cooperation in Tanzania is celebrating 60 years. Over the years a prioritized sector for the Swedish - Tanzanian partnership has been the energy sector. Sweden has invested heavily in the energy sector in mainland Tanzania and on Zanzibar for close to six decades. These investments have included installation of power generating equipment and powerlines, feasibility studies, capacity building as well as institutional and policy development support. Sweden is recognised as one of the main development partners in energy in Tanzania. The Embassy of Sweden in Tanzania would now like to take stock of these investments over the last six decades have meant for general development in the country.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under 2023 firar ambassaden i Tanzania 60 &#xe5;r. Eneregisektorn har varit en prioriterad sektor f&#xf6;r det svensk-tanzaniska partnerskapet under &#xe5;ren. Sverige har investerat stort i energisektorn p&#xe5; fastlandet och p&#xe5; Zanzibar. Dessa investeringar har inkluderat installation f&#xf6;r generering av elektricitet och eln&#xe4;t, f&#xf6;rstudier, kapacitetsbyggande samt policyarbete.  Sverige &#xe4;r en av de fr&#xe4;msta givarna i energisektorn i Tanzania.  Ambassaden vill nu dra l&#xe4;rdom fr&#xe5;n vad sex decennier av investeringar i energisektorn har haft f&#xf6;r betydelse f&#xf6;r landets utveckling i stort.</narrative>
  </description>
